  "summary": "Sitting on the short box with feet under the strap and arms overhead: turn to one side, lean back, travel round through the back to the other side and come up.",
  "steps": [
    "Short box across the carriage in front of the shoulder rests; sit in the middle facing the footbar, feet under the strap, knees soft.",
    "Arms overhead, sitting tall.",
    "Breathe in to turn the chest to one side, hips facing front.",
    "Lean back on that diagonal, circle round behind to the other side.",
    "Breathe out to lift back to sitting. Repeat the other way."
